    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Queen\u2019s Vanguard is a 3D tower defense game blending chess tactics with strategic warfare. Deploy towers inspired by chess pieces, unleash powerful abilities, and defend your kingdom against relentless waves of enemies. With many levels, tactical upgrades, and evolving challenges, can you master the battlefield? Plan your defense, adapt your strategy, and lead your vanguard to victory!</p>",
